<title>USA: Aydin forms European unit.</title>
<headline>Aydin forms European unit.</headline>
<dateline>HORSHAM, Pa. 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aydin Corp said on Monday that its facilities in the United Kingdom and Aydin International have been combined to form Aydin Europe Ltd.</p>
<p>Aydin Europe will assist with the marketing, sales, installation, equipment maintenance, contract negotiations and management for all Aydin products and systems, the company said.</p>
<p>Aydin makes telecommunications equipment and systems, color terminals, computer systems, radar and support components.</p>
